# Commits that changed formatting only, and should not be blamed for the lines they touched.
#
# `git blame` does not read this file on its own. Point git at it once per clone:
#
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub's blame view reads it automatically, with no configuration.
#
# Only whole-tree reformats belong here -- a commit that changed behaviour must stay blameable even if it also reformatted.
